      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The summoner can command up to two squads of minions with a maximum of 4 minions per squad. They can only have one squad of signature minions active at any time. At the start of each of the summoner's turns, up to three <strong>skeletons</strong> appear in unoccupied spaces within 5 squares of the summoner. On each of the summoner's turns, they direct the squad of skeletons to move and use a main action.</p><ul><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.draw-steel.summons.Actor.DJaSvLl2TYt3u04I]{Skeleton - 1 Malice Per Minion}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.draw-steel.summons.Actor.lsWE4HI1WhRRBzB5]{Zombie Lumberer - 2 Malice for 2 Minions}</p></li><li><p>@UUID[Compendium.draw-steel.summons.Actor.XFe92tDaWgokVdrS]{Accursed Mummy - 3 Malice for 3 Minions}</p></li></ul>",
